  "rules": {
    "opening": "Keep colored mana plus acceleration, an early Elf, or a castable Demonic Tutor; stop after two mulligans (six cards in multiplayer with its free first mulligan).",
    "develop": "Make land drops; develop mana, then draw engines and Lathril, then a wide Elf board.",
    "tribe": "Choose Elf for the registered tribal payoffs.",
    "mana": "Cast with native automatic payment. Never float mana without a selected useful action.",
    "recovery": "Reserve recursion and sweepers; do not cast them merely because they are legal.",
    "combat": "Prefer Lathril connections and preserve the ten-Elf drain board; use native attack pairs.",
    "tutor": "Prefer interaction when behind and engines otherwise. Overrun requires a demonstrated lethal attack.",
    "uncertainty": "Only escalate among complete policy-approved choices. Unsupported mechanics fail visibly.",
    "scry": "For native Scry 1, bottom redundant lands once four land drops are available, and delay expensive situational cards on an undeveloped board."
